{"server":"cn","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_05_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_05","title":"8:31P.M.","storyCode":"CB-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"0d7924fa4f1d61e6c87e31b07086a019b7a0e9bf3fa191dd24103aa33037d406","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"8:52 P.M.  天气/多云\n龙门贫民窟"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧！想活命就告诉我们，鼠王到底在哪儿！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贫民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不知道啊！什么鼠王......真的没听说过啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敬酒不吃吃罚酒——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，卡彭先生说过不要随便对平民动手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这种下三滥的货色能算市民吗？遮遮掩掩的，说不定就是个感染者垃圾！还敢装糊涂！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贫民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等！别打了！我真的不知道啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘴硬！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贫民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔——呃，呕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，别管这家伙了，恶心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看名单，下一个老东西似乎就住在这里不远，是个卖鱼丸的，就在生鲜卖场对面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，浪费时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贫民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕，哈啊——骨头都断了，这帮——该死的——下手真重，嘎哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贫民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"必须得......告诉他们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那边的，站住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们有什么事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，注意旁边那个男的，我总觉得不是什么善茬。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（龙门当地的帮派？不用担心，按照卡彭先生的报告，都是小角色。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我有点事情要问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"谁也不想惹上麻烦，对吧？乖乖回答我们，我们就走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的拳头上有血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，只是些不配合的垃圾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"但是像你们这样的好市民，当然会配合我们的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"这是威胁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"大家心里清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"那我拒绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......拒绝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你好像弄错了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，你也想变成那边巷子里的垃圾，被打得半死不活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"槐琥，我刚才听到的惨叫声......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"——你们刚才说了，“垃圾”，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"以防万一我多问一句，你是指这里的居民吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我没那么多时间陪你废话，赶紧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"敢、敢还手！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"都给我上——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"下一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"不，算了，反正你们也就只是一群不入流的喽啰，一起上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"古往今来，邪不压正，你们这些滥伤无辜的下九流，何足挂齿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"什么情况！？这女人的动作——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那就尝尝弩弹——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......慢着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咕！松手！你这混账！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你这种人，属于冰箱断电馊了三天的海胆，差不多那个感觉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，我不该学槐琥咬文嚼字的，还是直接点好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好大的劲，等！等等！要断了！要断了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"把武器放下，滚出这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我知道了，你先放手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......但果然还是应该弄脱臼比较好吧。毕竟你拿着那么危险的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！你，你真下得去手——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这两个人怎么回事？我没听说这附近有什么注意目标啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，先走，回头再说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你们是哪个帮派的，都不会有好下场的！该死的龙门人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"不，都说了我不是黑社会，为什么都喜欢以貌取人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"先别管这些，救人要紧，我去那边看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"——别动，我来帮你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贫民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿孑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，都是皮外伤，别急，我这就去叫医生，他们离这不远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贫民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿孑！别管我，先去找你董阿伯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贫民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们下一个目标就是他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","aliases":["槐琥"]},{"speakerId":"char_272_strong","aliases":["孑"]}]}
